pify.com/s/files/1/0306/4076/7108/files/girl-in-highchair-with-walnut-footrest.jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggIecTy_s5I_alt","label":"ggIecTy_s5I_alt","default":"Child in ikea high chair with a tray placemat, using a dark wood footrest against a blue paneled wall"},{"type":"html","id":"ggIecTy_s5I_title","label":"ggIecTy_s5I_title","default":"Child in Highchair with Dark Wood Footrest"},{"type":"html","id":"ggVVeKAnDTS_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggVVeKAnDTS_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0306/4076/7108/files/child-in-highchair-with-cushion-placemat-footrest.jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggVVeKAnDTS_alt","label":"ggVVeKAnDTS_alt","default":"Child in an IKEA ANTILOP high chair with YBG cushion, footrest, and tray placemat in a home setting with wooden floor and furniture."},{"type":"html","id":"ggVVeKAnDTS_title","label":"ggVVeKAnDTS_title","default":"Title"},{"type":"html","id":"ggGOZORGXlr_text","label":"ggGOZORGXlr_text","default":"Decreases Choking Risk"},{"type":"html","id":"ggm0koQ_6n2_text","label":"ggm0koQ_6n2_text","default":"<p>A lack of stability causes a slumping position that increases choking risk. Footrests help stabilize the core, which allows the swallow to work in a timely fashion, closing off the airway so liquid and food go right past the route to the lungs.</p>"}],
